WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:09.020
Hello. I’m Dr. Arash Taqavi, with a doctorate in psychology,

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:15.070
a university lecturer and director of a Center of Excellence [Persian name partly unclear],

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.650
the Transformation Center of Excellence, at California Miramar University.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:27.960
I’m pleased to join you on March 7, 2021, or 17 Esfand [Persian year unclear],

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:35.300
from 10 AM to noon California time, or 9:30 to 11:30 PM Iran time,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:42.680
with the Iranian graduate student community at the university in Irvine,

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.740
the University of California, Irvine, UCI,

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.440
for a two-hour workshop

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:56.460
on managing stress, especially during and after the coronavirus pandemic.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:00.040
Registration details for the workshop will be… [recording cuts off]
